SUMMARY:Astrology Workshop: Your North & South Node
DESCRIPTION:Senseful Soul’s Asheville Healing Community🧘🏻‍♀️
 🏳️‍🌈🪐🔮\nIt is said the North Node points us to what our so
 ul came here to learn in this life and the South Node is what we already l
 earned in a past life.\n\nIn this months astrology workshop we will cover:
 \nThe importance of the lunar nodes in astrology and cover your personal s
 ign/house to give a more personal understanding of how you relate to this 
 energy individually.\n\nNote: Bring your chart if you have it or we can he
 lp when you arrive. Birth times are not required but always encouraged for
  more personal accuracy.\n\n*Donation Event $ for community accessibility*
 \nRecommended donation $20 - 30\n\\(cash \\| card \\| venmo \\| cashapp ac
 cepted at venue\\)\n\n\\*Jenn has been a practicing Astrologer for 8+ year
 s and offers Astrology readings live virtual and locally in Asheville sens
 efulwellness.com\n\nPersonal Readings Available at: [sensefulwellness.com]
 (http://sensefulwellness.com/)
